    "closingDate": null,
    "jobDescription": "<p>We at Car Dekho Group are seeking a motivated and talented Junior AI Application Engineer to join our team. This role is ideal for individuals who are passionate about AI and eager to develop their skills in building and optimizing AI models, with a strong interest in data science principles. The successful candidate will contribute to the design and implementation of AI solutions, particularly in the area of Generative AI.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, '-apple-system', Blink Mac System Font, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><b>Key\n\nRESPONSIBILITIES:\n</b></span></p><p><b style=\"font-family:Roboto, '-apple-system', Blink Mac System Font, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">AI Expertise :</b></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, '-apple-system', Blink Mac System Font, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">Assist in the design and deployment of efficient vector databases to support large-scale Generative AI projects.</span></li><li>Support the development and enhancement of Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines for robust information retrieval and text generation.</li><li>Help integrate the Pydantic AI or any other Agentic frameworks and implement context-aware techniques for Generative AI models.</li><li>Contribute to the creation and management of human-in-the-loop workflows to ensure output accuracy, control, and bias mitigation in Generative AI applications.</li><li>Monitor and evaluate Generative AI model performance, assisting in addressing potential biases and fairness concerns.</li><li>Apply prompt engineering techniques to refine model interactions and improve the quality of outputs.</li></ul><p><b style=\"font-family:Roboto, '-apple-system', Blink Mac System Font, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">Data Science Foundation :</b></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, '-apple-system', Blink Mac System Font, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">Utilize statistical and machine learning methods to analyze and prepare data for Generative AI projects.</span></li><li>Stay updated on the latest advancements in Generative AI and related fields (e.g., Natural Language Processing, Deep Learning).</li><li>Communicate technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.</li><li>Collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams (engineering, research, product) to deliver impactful Generative AI solutions.</li></ul><p><b style=\"font-family:Roboto, '-apple-system', Blink Mac System Font, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\nQUALIFICATIONS:\n</b></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:Roboto, '-apple-system', Blink Mac System Font, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\">Some experience or academic knowledge in building and optimizing Generative AI models (e.g., LLMs, RAG pipelines, fine-tuning).</span></li><li>Basic understanding of vector databases and their use in Generative AI.</li><li>Familiarity with prompt engineering techniques.</li><li>Proficiency in Python programming and exposure to relevant AI frameworks (e.g., Tensor Flow, Py Torch).</li><li>Solid foundation in statistics, machine learning, and data analysis.</li><li>Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities.</li><li>Good communication and teamwork skills.</li><li>Relevant internship experience or academic projects in AI/Data Science roles is a plus.</li></ul>",
